< Load-Info > ::= < AVP-Header: 1600 >
< Overload-Metric >
* { Overload-Info-Scope }
[ Supported-Scopes ]
* [ Overload-Algorithm ]
[ Period-Of-Validity ]
[ Session-Group ]
[ Load ]
* [ AVP ]

< OC-OLR > ::= < AVP-Header: TBD2 >
< OC-Sequence-Number >
[ OC-Report-Type ]
[ OC-Reduction-Percentage ]
[ OC-Validity-Duration ]
* [ AVP ]

< OC-Supported-Features > ::= < AVP-Header: TBD1 >
< OC-Sequence-Number >
[ OC-Feature-Vector ]
* [ AVP ]
